### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### FLUJO ADMIN — happy path completo
###
### Pre-requisito: el user "test" debe existir y tener role=ADMIN.
### Si es la primera vez:
###   1. Ejecutar "Register admin" (más abajo).
###   2. Promover en BBDD:
###        UPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE username = 'test';
###   3. Ejecutar "Login admin" para sacar token con rol ADMIN.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiV1 = {{host}}/api/v1


### Register admin (solo la primera vez)
POST {{apiV1}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Login admin → guarda el token
POST {{apiV1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}


### Ver mi perfil
GET {{apiV1}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Listar todos los users (privilegio admin)
GET {{apiV1}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Containers — CRUD completo
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Listar todos los containers (admin ve todos los del host)
GET {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Listar solo running
GET {{apiV1}}/containers?all=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear container → guarda el id
POST {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:alpine",
  "name": "admin-demo",
  "autoStart": true
}

> {%
client.global.set("containerId", response.body.id);
%}


### Inspect
GET {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Logs (últimas 50 líneas)
GET {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/logs?tail=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Stop
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Start
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Restart
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Borrar container (limpia ownership en BBDD)
DELETE {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
